{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike \u00d7 Strategy Battle! Test Your Wit and Ingenuity on an Epic Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553210/extras/kemo.gif?t=1741044059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Set Off on a Grand Adventure!!</strong><br>Sneak away from Mama and embark on an exciting journey! But be careful\u2014danger lurks around every corner! Plan your battle strategies and guide this adorable little one to victory!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553210/extras/asasin.gif?t=1741044059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape from Mama!!!</strong><br>The more turns you take in battle, the closer Mama gets! Observe enemy movements and defeat them in as few turns as possible to stay ahead!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553210/extras/kagami.gif?t=1741044059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Two Adventures Are the Same!!</strong><br>Enemies, skills, and events change every time you play! Keep exploring, gain experience, and refine your strategies!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553210/extras/Sprite-0021.gif?t=1741044059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Growth and Ingenuity Will Decide Your Fate!!</strong><br>Everyone starts their adventure on equal footing. But through experience, <i>you</i> will become stronger! Use your wits and strategy to carve your own path!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553210/extras/Sprite-0024.gif?t=1741044059\" /></p><p 